---
<!--
  TEST HOMEPAGE (draft, 2026-11-17). The live homepage at / is untouched. Not indexed.
  Copy and its approval status live in src/data/testHome.ts.

  One brand, a look per buyer. Every trailer gets its own showcase, like Tesla and Rivian.
  On-sale trailers get Reserve and specs. Coming-next trailers get a signup only.
    Brand  Hero, Lineup (all six + the shared power numbers), Process to Close
    Work   Cargo, Workstation, JobsitePain   daylight, heavy type, data plate
    Event  Event                             night, screen glow, thin wide type, marquee
    Garage Garage                            black, light beam, slanted metal name
    Relief Disaster Relief                   cool grade, field grid, framed corners
    Camper Camper + first-word signup        light, centered, sentence case

  Section rhythm (never two photo sections next to each other):
    Hero P, Lineup D, Cargo L, Workstation P, JobsitePain D, Event P, Garage D,
    Disaster Relief P, Camper L, Process D, Guarantee L, Built P, Faq L, Close D
  Keep the ids top, cta, walkthrough, sheet and faq so Nav, MobileBar and Close work.
-->
<Base title="Test homepage | SPOG Trailers" noindex>
  <Nav />
  <TestHero />
  <LineupIndex />
  <ShowCargo />
  <ShowWorkstation />
  <JobsitePain />
  <ShowEvent />
  <ShowGarage />
  <ShowRelief />
  <ShowCamper />
  <Process />
  <Guarantee />
  <Built />
  <Faq />
  <Close />
  <Footer />
  <MobileBar />
</Base>
